# Build artifacts.
#
# Objects land next to their sources rather than in a build directory, so
# without this a build leaves several dozen untracked files in the tree and
# anything genuinely new gets lost among them.

*.o
*.d
*.bc

# The core itself, under any of the names the Makefile gives it per platform.
*_libretro.so
*_libretro.dll
*_libretro.dylib
*_libretro_*.so
*_libretro_*.dylib
*_libretro_*.a
